    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a nightmarish house of identical rooms, you're haunted by a sinister presence. The mimic, a creature that can perfectly imitate its surroundings, lurks in the shadows, waiting to strike. With every step, the tension mounts, and the line between reality and illusion blurs. Can you uncover the mimic's deception and escape the house of mimics before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Observation Is Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In otherwise identical rooms, the Mimic pretends to be an ordinary household item. Your task is to meticulously examine each room. Pay attention to the smallest details, notice the subtle signs that might reveal the Mimic's true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is shrouded in an eerie atmosphere, with flickering lights, and unsettling silence punctuated by strange noises. The mimic\u2019s presence intensifies the horror, as it manipulates your mind, playing tricks on your perception and preying on your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single-Player or Co-Op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the chilling world of House of Mimics alone or with friends. Whether you prefer the challenge of single-player mode or cooperative gameplay, the choice is yours. 1-4 players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a nightmarish house of identical rooms, you're haunted by a sinister presence. The mimic, a creature that can perfectly imitate its surroundings, lurks in the shadows, waiting to strike. With every step, the tension mounts, and the line between reality and illusion blurs. Can you uncover the mimic's deception and escape the house of mimics before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Observation Is Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In otherwise identical rooms, the Mimic pretends to be an ordinary household item. Your task is to meticulously examine each room. Pay attention to the smallest details, notice the subtle signs that might reveal the Mimic's true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is shrouded in an eerie atmosphere, with flickering lights, and unsettling silence punctuated by strange noises. The mimic\u2019s presence intensifies the horror, as it manipulates your mind, playing tricks on your perception and preying on your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single-Player or Co-Op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the chilling world of House of Mimics alone or with friends. Whether you prefer the challenge of single-player mode or cooperative gameplay, the choice is yours. 1-4 players.</p>",
    "short_description": "In a house of identical rooms, you are trapped with a lurking Mimic that disguises as household objects. It thrives on deception, toying with your mind and senses. Observe your surroundings, expose the mimic, and escape - alone or with friends.",
